      "prep": "## Luke / Trent Prep\n\n---\n\n### OS Skits\n**Status:** Three concepts greenlit; now in scripting/logistics phase.\n- Clayton to write up all three and send to Speaker 3\n- Scripts, locations, and needs still to be built out\n- **Blocker:** None yet, but nothing is scripted \u2014 Clayton's writeup is the critical next step.\n\n---\n\n### Andrea Onboarding\n**Status:** Tuesday kickoff planned; access provisioning in motion.\n- Speaker 3 to message Andrea with Tuesday schedule and loop Brian\n- Thomas/backend to grant OS super admin\n- Add Andrea to OS + OS sales Slack channels\n- **Blocker:** Intercom seat on hold until Gwen's transition is official \u2014 don't rename James's account in the meantime.\n\n---\n\n### Strength Scheduling for Tactical\n**Status:** Scoped for early next year; groups/tags + bulk booking are the two core asks.\n- Groups/tags (filtering, Zapier) pulling parity from TeamBuildr Strength\n- Staff-side bulk booking to be built alongside\n- Booking restrictions by group intentionally out of scope\n- **Blocker:** None active \u2014 this is a next-year build. Beaver Fit (~$300M) flagged as a possible referral angle via Jason worth monitoring.\n\n---\n\n### Claude-Assisted Onboarding\n**Status:** In testing setup.\n- Next: create fake onboarding script and feed into Claude for testing\n- **Blocker:** None noted; waiting on script creation to begin real evaluation.\n\n---\n\n### StoryBuildr\n**Status:** Active; launch date being finalized.\n- Audit individual stage design and layout in progress\n- Email Mark re: finalized 9/23 launch date pending\n- **Blocker:** None noted; confirm launch date communication to Mark is sent.\n\n---\n\n### Pipeline\n**Status:** 29 deals active; 7 demos MTD.\n- 19 In-Trial / Post Demo\n- 5 Out of Demo / Need Update \u2014 worth flagging for follow-up prioritization\n- 3 No Trial / Post Demo, 2 On-Hold\n- **Blocker:** None noted, but the \"Need Update\" bucket (5) is the one to watch.",
